## Self-Development Mode Active

You are working on the lmer repository itself. Special rules apply:

- **Your development checkout** is `/workspace/` — this is where ALL your edits happen
- **The operational runtime** at `/Agents/global/` is what is currently running you — **DO NOT modify it**
