- Changes you make in `/workspace/` will NOT affect your current session — they are development copies, not the operational ones
- `PYTHONPATH` puts `/workspace/src` ahead of the operational tree, so `pytest` and Python imports use your development code. Do not take this on trust: the startup banner above prints the `lmer_cli` path this session actually resolved, and `tests/test_import_provenance.py` fails the suite if it is not under `/workspace/` (issue #198 — before that fix, this bullet claimed something that was not true)
